    "problemStatement": "District offices lack reliable secure internet access",
    "problemDescription": "Many district offices operate without secure Wi-Fi, relying on personal hotspots or unsecured public networks to do casework and constituent business. Connectivity depends on what each office happens to arrange rather than a standard the CAO provides, which leaves some offices with weaker security and slower service than others.",
