    "problemStatement": "House Rule 24 blocks offices from cosponsoring events with outside groups",
    "problemDescription": "District offices often want to hold a constituent service event, such as a job fair or a benefits enrollment day, alongside a local nonprofit or service provider, but House Rule 24 restricts co-branding and joint sponsorship with outside organizations. Offices either run the event alone with less reach or drop the partnership that would have made it more useful.",
