    "problemStatement": "No one coordinates priorities across House digital infrastructure",
    "problemDescription": "House digital infrastructure, systems, tools, and platforms across offices and support agencies, is maintained and developed without a single body setting priorities across it. Individual offices and support agencies make infrastructure decisions largely in isolation, so investment and maintenance are uncoordinated at the institutional level.",
    "solutionStatement": "Establish a digital infrastructure working group",
