    "problemStatement": "Newly elected Members have no dedicated help setting up their office",
    "problemDescription": "A Member-elect must build a staff, set up payroll and systems, and open a Washington office in the weeks between election and swearing-in, without any staff of their own to help. Everything falls to the Member-elect personally or to campaign staff unfamiliar with House administrative systems.",
    "solutionStatement": "Authorize a paid transition staff hire for Members-elect",
